LITERATURE CHECK — Bell/CHSH fine-tuning project
Date: 2026-08-23 | Tasks: (1) anchor verification, (2) novelty sweep 2015–2026,
(3) FGHK 2018 verification.
Method: direct arxiv.org fetches (API + abs pages) and local reference lists.
The WebSearch tool proved unreliable in this environment (see §D); no citation
or quote below rests on it. All quotes were re-read from the cited source
